OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm a lawyer by day, female dhol
OL,4,Adrummer by night'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBy day, Sandi Kaur is a lawyer... by
OL,7,Fnight, she is a drummer in the UK's
OL,8,Ffirst and - they claim - only team of
OL,9,Ffemale bhangra dhol players and
OL,10,Fdancers.
OL,12,FEternal Taal have performed at
OL,13,FGlastonbury, been in Hollywood films
OL,14,Fand have appeared on The Graham Norton
OL,15,FShow.
OL,17,FThey most recently took to the stage at
OL,18,FThe European Athletics Championships in
OL,19,Fthe city - but Kaur says, in some ways,
OL,20,Fher two "jobs" do not feel too
OL,21,Fdissimilar.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
